            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ScreenTake 0.1.19</h2><ul><li>Upload your own background image and keep it inside saved projects, with consistent previews and export.</li><li>Choose 16 wallpapers in a square, four-column grid, including new 4K Silk, Pastel, Breeze, and Mint presets.</li><li>Draw, move, and resize manual zoom regions on recordings, imported videos, and phone layouts.</li><li>Adjust phone corner rounding separately and use floating phone chrome.</li></ul><p>Requires Apple Silicon and macOS 13 or later.</p>]]></description>
